      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "We chose Solahart - Namoi Sustainable Energy for our 8kW Solar installation with battery and Gateway as they came on site for a face to face consultation and site inspection, and were happy to locate the panels and inverter on the shed with the battery and gateway on the house. We also purchased a new PowerStore Hot Water System as part of the package. Their customer service was excellent, they listened to us and addressed all our questions. They organised the grid connection and supplied us a partially prefilled smart meter application form for our energy supplier. The installation did get put back due to weather but when it went ahead the guys were on time and got the system installed, up and running in the two days they allocated for the install. In spite of a couple of hiccups. The installation team were NS Energy employees and were lovely, polite fellows.",
